@tempo 95
@swing 0.6
@fx vinyl 0.25
@fx reverb 0.6
@instrument lead bell 0.95
@instrument bass cello 0.6
@instrument chord harmonium 0.4
@sample kick "drums/Kick OG"
@sample snare "drums/Snare Classic Record"
@sample hat "drums/HiHat Muddy"
@sample perc "drums/Foley Subtle"

kick:  x . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .
       x . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .

snare: . . . . . . . . x . . . . . . .
       . . . . . . . . x . . . . . . .

hat:   x . . . x . . . x . . . x . . .
       x . . . x . . . x . . . x . . .

perc:  . . . . . . . . . . x . . . . .
       . . . . . . . . . . x . . . . .


bass:  Em . . . B1 . . . Em . . . B1 . . .

lead:  . . G4 . . A4 . B4 . . C5 . B4 . A4 .
       G4 . . . A4 . . . G4 . . . . . . .
       . . E4 . . F#4 . G4 . . A4 . . . . .
       G4 . . . . F#4 . E4 . . . . . . .


